Package: mica-mqttd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: micad (= 0.1.0-2), passwd, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Mica OS MQTT application-data bridge
 Publishes the item trees of enrolled com.mica.* applications to MQTT and,
 in full mode, carries writes back. Started by micad when MQTT is enabled.
